+ a={a}
+ m={m}
+ calib_rfe={3/2*fact2}
+ calib_imy={2/3*fact}
XSch_ol magn_b1U magn2 Trafoschenkel_Yy; oben links
+ PARAMS: SN={SN/3} U1N={U1Nenn/sqrt(3)} fN={fN} N1={N1} i0={i0} p0={p0}
+ a={a}
+ m={m}
+ calib_rfe={3*fact2}
+ calib_imy={1/3*fact}
XSch_or magn2 magn_b1W Trafoschenkel_Yy; oben rechts
