* other ctrl mechanism for l_ 
.SUBCKT RUYy0_400k_120k_300MVA_simple_2  1U  1V  1W  1N  2U  2V  2W  2N
+	PARAMS:
+	SN=300e6
+	U1Nenn=400e3
+	U20=120e3
+	fn={fn1}
+	N1=1000
+	uR=0.002
+	uX=0.2
+	i0=0.0006
+	p0=0.0004
+   l_=0
+   middle=0
+   stproz=1.0
.PARAM
+ ctrl={1+(l_-middle)*stproz/100}
+ S1N={SN/3}
+ U1N={U1Nenn/sqrt(3)}
+ U20N={U20/sqrt(3)}
+ I1N={S1N/U1N}
+ Z1N={U1N/I1N}
+ omegaN={(2*pi)*fN}
+ R1={Z1N*uR/2}
+ L1s={Z1N*uX/2/omegaN}
+ RFe={(U1N*U1N)/(p0*S1N)}
+ N2={N1*U20N/U1N}
+ R2={R1*N2/N1*N2/N1}
+ Xh={(U1N*U1N)/(S1N*sqrt(i0*i0-p0*p0))}
+ L1={Xh/omegaN}
+ L2={L1*N2/N1*N2/N1}
+ sigma1={L1s/L1}
+ sigma={2*sigma1-sigma1*sigma1}
+ k={sqrt(1-sigma)}
* U-Phase
R1U 1U Up  {R1}
RfeU Up 1N {RFe}
L1U Up 1N  {L1}
L2U Us 2N  {L2} rser=0
K12U L1U L2U {k}
R2U Us 2U  {R2}
* V-Phase
R1V 1V Vp  {R1}
RfeV Vp 1N {RFe}
L1V Vp 1N  {L1}
L2V Vs 2N  {L2} rser=0
K12V L1V L2V {k}
R2V Vs 2V  {R2}
* W-Phase
R1W 1W Wp  {R1}
RfeW Wp 1N {RFe}
L1W Wp 1N  {L1}
L2W Ws 2N  {L2} rser=0
K12W L1W L2W {k}
R2W Ws 2W  {R2}
*
RGND1U 1U 0 1e12
RGND1V 1V 0 1e12
RGND1W 1W 0 1e12
RGND2U 2U 0 1e12
RGND2V 2V 0 1e12
RGND2W 2W 0 1e12
RGND1N 1N 0 1e12
RGND2N 2N 0 1e12
.ENDS
*$

* OLD_simple model NOTE: here uX is quadratic dependent on l_ 
.SUBCKT RUYy0_400k_120k_300MVA_simple_3  1U  1V  1W  1N  2U  2V  2W  2N
+	PARAMS:
+	SN=300e6
+	U1Nenn=400e3
+	U20=120e3
+	fn={fn1}
+	N1=1000
+	uR=0.002
+	uX=0.2
+	i0=0.0006
+	p0=0.0004
+   l_=0
+   middle=0
+   stproz=1.0
.PARAM
+ S1N={SN/3}
+ U1N={U1Nenn/sqrt(3)}
+ U20N={U20/sqrt(3)}
+ I1N={S1N/U1N}
+ Z1N={U1N/I1N}
+ omegaN={(2*pi)*fN}
+ R1={Z1N*uR/2}
+ L1s={Z1N*uX/2/omegaN}
+ RFe={(U1N*U1N)/(p0*S1N)}
+ N2={N1*U20N/U1N}
+ R2={R1*N2/N1*N2/N1}
+ Xh={(U1N*U1N)/(S1N*sqrt(i0*i0-p0*p0))}
+ L1={Xh/omegaN}
+ L2={L1*N2/N1*N2/N1}
+ sigma1={L1s/L1}
+ sigma={2*sigma1-sigma1*sigma1}
+ k={sqrt(1-sigma)}
+ ctrl={1+(l_-middle)*stproz/100}
+ ctrl2={ctrl*ctrl}
* U-Phase
R1U 1U Up  {R1*ctrl2}
RfeU Up 1N {RFe}
L1U Up 1N  {L1*ctrl2} rser=0
L2U Us 2N  {L2} rser=0
K12U L1U L2U {k}
R2U Us 2U  {R2}
* V-Phase
R1V 1V Vp  {R1*ctrl2}
RfeV Vp 1N {RFe}
L1V Vp 1N  {L1*ctrl2} rser=0
L2V Vs 2N  {L2} rser=0
K12V L1V L2V {k}
R2V Vs 2V  {R2}
* W-Phase
R1W 1W Wp  {R1*ctrl2}
RfeW Wp 1N {RFe}
L1W Wp 1N  {L1*ctrl2} rser=0
L2W Ws 2N  {L2} rser=0
K12W L1W L2W {k}
R2W Ws 2W  {R2}
*
RGND1U 1U 0 1e12
RGND1V 1V 0 1e12
RGND1W 1W 0 1e12
RGND2U 2U 0 1e12
RGND2V 2V 0 1e12
RGND2W 2W 0 1e12
RGND1N 1N 0 1e12
RGND2N 2N 0 1e12
.ENDS
*$


